cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this software contributed to your work, please cite it as below."
title: "RietCalc Demo"
abstract: >-
  Interatomic distances and their estimated standard deviations from a CIF:
  symmetry expansion with special positions, neighbour search across lattice
  repeats, first-order error propagation from the cell and the coordinates, and
  the table of symmetry-unique bonds. Demonstration version of the RietCalc
  program.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-15"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/bolevin/rietcalc-demo"
authors:
  - alias: bolevin
  - family-names: Levin
    given-names: "A. A."
keywords:
  - crystallography
  - CIF
  - interatomic distances
  - estimated standard deviation
  - coordination
  - powder diffraction
